# Volmeter fed through a real source: magnitude = RMS, peak = sample peak over frames/4*4 samples (+ previous 4), all scaled by the source volume and converted to dB; input_peak is not scaled by volume.
init 48000 2
clock 1000000000
source a input
meter_new 0 0
meter_attach 0 a
meter_cb 0 add
meter_channels 0
output a 48000 2 1024 1000000000 sine 1000 0.5 0
set a volume 0.5
output a 48000 2 1024 1021333333 sine 1000 0.5 1024
set a mute 1
output a 48000 2 1024 1042666666 sine 1000 0.5 2048
set a mute 0
output a 48000 2 1024 1064000000 const 0
